        },
        {
            "title": "國際｜若民主黨重掌國會擬啟動調查 馬斯克揚言作出報復",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜若民主黨重掌國會擬啟動調查 馬斯克揚言作出報復\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e6cd3d35aab14a9b84d896addee28a7e5bc9c3f7f11e8c3427e591e579b8360d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜若民主黨重掌國會擬啟動調查 馬斯克揚言作出報復</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國11月即將舉行中期選舉，民主黨若重奪國會控制權，計劃就馬斯克領導的政府效率部、SpaceX政府合約、烏克蘭星盾網絡相關爭議展開多項調查。馬斯克公開揚言會向發起調查的民主黨人作出反擊，多名民主黨議員隨即回應，要求馬斯克到國會宣誓作證交代相關問題。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E8%8B%A5%E6%B0%91%E4%B8%BB%E9%BB%A8%E9%87%8D%E6%8E%8C%E5%9C%8B%E6%9C%83%E6%93%AC%E5%95%9F%E5%8B%95%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5-%E9%A6%AC%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B%E6%8F%9A%E8%A8%80%E4%BD%9C%E5%87%BA%E5%A0%B1%E5%BE%A9-100017174.html",
