        {
            "title": "比特幣目標衝破84,000美元，巨鯨提幣潮湧現，機構活動升溫",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"獨家：Bitget接入Sygnum場外銀行託管模式\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/08913662b410f666cfde372f87969ca7f8459d240cb6aa716b4f2d73b2436a0a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEB3E0UM_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">獨家：Bitget接入Sygnum場外銀行託管模式</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 比特幣交投於81,000美元以下，大額持幣者提幣及機構錢包活動頻繁，令市場對幣價回升至84,000美元燃起希望，儘管加密貨幣市場整體仍充滿不確定性。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至美國東部時間週六凌晨1:15（北京時間週六下午13:15），比特幣下跌1.25%，報80,841.9美元，守穩於80,000美元附近的關鍵需求區間上方，此前市場曾出現一輪拋售壓力。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據鏈上數據分析平台Lookonchain顯示，自10月1日起，40個新創建的錢包從做市商Wintermute提取了約9,458枚比特幣，價值約7.715億美元。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-78fd9082-beb9-3c54-b09c-c5a17c214274-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此類大規模轉帳顯示大額持幣者活動明顯，但僅憑提幣動作，尚無法判斷這些比特幣是新購入還是轉入長期託管。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">與此同時，據報道富達（Fidelity）的比特幣ETF錢包從幣安（Binance）收到282.63枚比特幣，價值約2,308萬美元；與貝萊德（BlackRock）相關的錢包則另外收到384.77枚比特幣，價值約3,140萬美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">上述交易由鏈上分析平台Onchain Lens標記，反映機構錢包持續活躍，但不一定代表ETF有新資金流入。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">10月22日，比特幣現貨交易所淨流出約4.6555億美元，以美元計算的交易所儲備下降1.35%至2,263.3億美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">技術指標方面，拋物線轉向指標（Parabolic SAR）轉為看漲，資金流量指數（Money Flow Index）升至53.74，顯示動能有所改善。若比特幣能持續守穩81,000美元附近，則向84,000美元進發的可能性將進一步增強。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另外，Strategy（NASDAQ）主席邁克爾·塞勒（Michael Saylor）暗示將有更多與比特幣相關的動態，此前該公司披露於10月12日至18日期間斥資2,210萬美元購入267枚比特幣。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Strategy目前持有848,517枚比特幣，累計購入成本約640.2億美元。該公司亦在兩週內斥資3.855億美元回購STRC優先股，遠超同期2,210萬美元的比特幣購入金額。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另一方面，比特幣核心開發者批准了一項新政策，針對人工智能工具可輕易重新發現的安全漏洞，加快披露與修補速度，取代原本可能曠日持久的保密披露機制。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次政策調整，源於人工智能輔助工具在比特幣基礎設施中發現漏洞的案例日益增多。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此外，比特幣與美國中期選舉之間的歷史關聯亦備受關注。過去幾次熊市低點均出現在中期選舉投票後，但比特幣今年7月的低點57,850美元卻早於11月選舉數月出現。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至10月22日，比特幣已從該低點回升約40%，顯示本輪市場週期或與以往選舉年的規律有所不同。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>今日加密貨幣行情：週六早盤山寨幣普遍下跌</strong></h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據最新市場快照，週六加密貨幣整體走低。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值排名第二的加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"以太幣\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:以太幣;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/ethereum/eth-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">以太幣</a>下跌1.0%，報2,380.28美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值排名第三的加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"XRP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:XRP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/xrp/xrp-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">XRP</a>下跌2.71%，報1.2907美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"Solana\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:Solana;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/solana/sol-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Solana</a>下跌2.01%，報102.40美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"BNB\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:BNB;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/bnb/bnb-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">BNB</a>下跌0.42%，報739.07美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Cardano下跌2.45%，報0.2114美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"狗狗幣（Dogecoin）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:狗狗幣（Dogecoin）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/dogecoin/doge-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">狗狗幣（Dogecoin）</a>下跌1.73%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">迷因幣方面，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"TRUMP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:TRUMP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/maga/trump-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">TRUMP</a>上漲4.09%，而<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/shiba-inu/shib-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）</a>則下跌0.79%。</p></div>",
